================================================================================
WORK
================================================================================
New page (apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Admin/ — adaptive SwiftUI View + @Observable model):
- DLQInspectorPage.swift           — page View: header, dismissible banners,
  StatusHeader, GlassPanel1 (entries), GlassPanel2 (audit), entry drawer (.sheet),
  replay .confirmationDialog. No business logic in the body.
- DLQInspectorPage.Model.swift     — DLQInspectorSource seam (P1/S8), DLQListPhase /
  DLQEntryPhase, @Observable DLQInspectorPageModel (faithful port of the web
  selected/pendingReplay/replayDisabledBanner state machine + the 4 data hooks),
  DLQEntriesProvider bridge to the reused EntriesTable, OSLog telemetry (P1/S11).
- DLQInspectorPage.Models.swift    — DLQListData / DLQEntryFull / DLQReplayOutcome /
  DLQReplayActionResult / DLQPayloadText (web decodeBase64Utf8). Foundation-only.
- DLQInspectorPage.StatusHeader.swift — 3 stat tiles + "replay disabled" banner.
- DLQInspectorPage.EntryDrawer.swift  — KV summary + inner/raw payload tabs + copy
  (UIPasteboard/NSPasteboard) + replay footer (web disable rules), adaptive sheet.
- DLQInspectorPage.Sources.swift   — InMemoryDLQInspectorSource (previews/tests) +
  DLQInspectorUnavailableSource (honest offline default until AppContainer vends the
  live feed — mirrors the app's UnavailableVehicleCommanding seam; never fake rows).
- DLQInspectorPage.Strings.swift   — P1/S10 i18n facade (web keys + native chrome).
- DLQInspectorPage.strings         — per-surface "DLQInspectorPage" string table.
- DLQInspectorPage.Previews.swift  — content/loading/empty/error/replay-disabled + drawer.
- DLQInspectorPage.Tests.swift     — XCTest: decode, list→table mapping, the replay
  reducer branches (ok closes+refreshes; disabled/forbidden banner; failed error),
  strings namespace, and the /admin/dlq deep-link.
- DLQInspectorRoute.swift          — DLQInspectorRouteRegistration hosts the page at
  AppRoute.admin; /admin/dlq deep-links to it via the existing AppRouteParser.

Navigation/build registration (Allowed: navigation registration + string catalog):
- Sources/TeslaSyncApp.swift  — chained DLQInspectorRouteRegistration.registry(base:)
  onto the routeHosts environment.
- project.yml                 — added `TeslaSync/Features` source path to the TeslaSync
  (iOS) + TeslaSync-macOS targets.
- .swiftlint.yml              — added `TeslaSync/Features` to `included`.

SI units: DLQ has no SI-unit fields (byte sizes via the web formatBytes port, counts
via fmtInt). No miles/mph/°F/psi/kWh introduced. No charts, no maps (manifest: 0/0).
Live SSE: DLQ is a polled surface (web refetchInterval), not an SSE live surface;
no >2min staleness indicator applies (ADR-013 scopes staleness to live SSE reads).

